</thead>
<tbody>
<tr>
<td><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/admissions/index.php">Apply Now</a></td>
<td><a href="https://www.ltcc.edu/admissions/campustours.php">Visit Campus</a></td>
<td><a title="Make a Plan" href="https://www.ltcc.edu/campusresources/counseling.php" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Make a Plan</a></td>
